==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns.
**1 [[Berserkory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The backliners you used for Baron Seal Strikes should make this stage easy enough. The Berserkory and Professor A are both 100% as well, meaning you should have zero struggle doing this stage.

